WEBVTT

00:02.223 --> 00:03.760
What can a walk reveal?

00:04.223 --> 00:06.690
GaitAI ForensicSearch.

00:07.208 --> 00:08.409
Two street recordings.

00:08.616 --> 00:09.433
One question:

00:09.896 --> 00:11.390
could this be the same person?

00:13.111 --> 00:14.439
Watch the white shoe.

00:14.519 --> 00:15.250
It lands.

00:15.543 --> 00:17.426
Then the same foot returns.

00:17.676 --> 00:19.770
That is one complete gait cycle.

00:20.012 --> 00:23.140
Pose estimation follows the joints through
each frame.

00:23.817 --> 00:26.900
Silhouette extraction separates the walker
from the scene.

00:27.071 --> 00:29.807
Recording A contains two complete cycles.

00:29.844 --> 00:31.880
Recording B contains five.

00:32.020 --> 00:35.510
The gait energy image averages the aligned
silhouettes.

00:36.165 --> 00:38.646
Ninety-nine point two in recording A.

00:38.864 --> 00:41.220
Ninety-six point four in recording B.

00:42.114 --> 00:44.230
Step-time asymmetry is withheld.

00:52.640 --> 00:55.030
The conclusion must follow the evidence.

00:55.423 --> 00:57.890
GaitAI ForensicSearch.

00:57.941 --> 00:59.480
Request a Demonstration.
